    <rigor-reason>Modifies `.tsx` (TipTap editor) with `compose`/`frontend`/`fluent-ui` tags; the frontend/fluent-ui tags trigger `&lt;ui-tests&gt;`. Step 9.5 code-review + adr-check run unconditionally.</rigor-reason>
